 (d) Requirements Applicable to All Dispositions and Admissions.  In addition to the requirements set forth in Sections 3.03(a), 3.03(b) and 3.03(c), any Disposition of a Membership Interest and any admission of an Assignee as a Member shall also be subject to the following requirements, and such Disposition (and admission, if applicable) shall not be effective unless such requirements are complied with; provided, however, that the non-disposing Members, in their sole and absolute discretion, may waive any of the following requirements:

